< \caption{Final-generation mean best-so-far feasible objective by mode (Bs = Baseline, Rx = Relaxed, Jt = Joint, Rk = Ranking, Hv = Hypervolume).  \textbf{Bold}: the winning mode(s), i.e. the modes that no other mode is significantly better than, provided that some mode is significantly better than another; no mark when no mode is (paired two-sided Wilcoxon signed-rank tests, $\alpha=0.05$, Holm-corrected over the mode pairs). Lower is better. The Wins row counts the configurations each mode wins, ties included; more wins are better.}
